 or watchlist candidate, include company, region, role title(s), careers URL, trip type, hiring signal, and fit. Aim for 6–8 useful candidates from the list. Partial answers are acceptable. Salvage will re-browse visited URLs — focus on visiting the right careers pages, not writing a long report. 
